I actually have a XL strategy:

1) I wait until I can pray (a couple of hundred turns initially)
2) I allow a single monster to drop HP below 6 HP.
3) Pray. If you MAX HP is <= 10+XL*5 you get a max HP bump of up to 5
points. 
4) If after this sequence I'm still below the limit, lather, rinse,
repeat.

Works for XL1 and XL2 very well. You can get a additional 10HP simply
by praying. So it increases your odds in the PR, while not damaging the
good effects (low level monster generation + cheaper cost for protection).

